    "turn_text": "Yeah, we're not keeping our promise. Our promise was, let's build the wall first. And then we can take care of internal enforcement. We can get rid of some of the incentives to come here. illegally and stay here illegally and then we'll have the wall there and will have a real secure border we can get the border secure but we know we've learned from nineteen eighty six but when that bill was passed we're told there'd be a million people that would come in and it wasn't just a million people when they came in with that amnesty was millions of people came in under that amnesty because of the promise of amnesty always increases border crossings And it's an incentive. And that's the incentive. And now what we're going to do is we're going to say, well, you know, if you come here illegally and you stay long enough. You'll get the next amnesty or you're going to get this version of them.",
