    "turn_idx": 97,
    "turn_text": "Yes, citizenship matters. It matters a lot. If this you can't have a country without borders. And if we don't force our borders, our citizenship is not valuable. This is a government that, by the people, for the people where we govern ourselves, we have got to make sure that we know who our fellow citizens are.",
